isWIoKCcIqCgnCI\"/><figcaption>Taylor Swift成《時代》風雲人物｜揭演唱會秘辛　1原因床上吃飯（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Taylor Swift成《時代》風雲人物｜揭演唱會秘辛　1原因床上吃飯（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231207/809462998455685120258649.jpeg/xA_M-OYjvUt9O6slT2XT1NNQgOFaj3l6yTeVvsk3lb4\"/><figcaption>Taylor Swift成《時代》風雲人物｜揭演唱會秘辛　1原因床上吃飯（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Taylor Swift成《時代》風雲人物｜揭演唱會秘辛　1原因床上吃飯（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231207/809463000850763776538071.jpeg/0HfsDbzY0q3_WKq2LGesvJkf1LRjMfcA-pOVUvqTlVI\"/><figcaption>Taylor Swift成《時代》風雲人物｜揭演唱會秘辛　1原因床上吃飯（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>BIGBANG合體開唱 周杰倫驚喜現身！私下狂歡合照曝光</p><p>周子瑜新加坡辣秀長腿！合體F1人氣車手玩黏土超萌</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T09:04:56.480020+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2041,"images":29,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}